{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/2025/0521/c25130a3053556/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:55.674540+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/2025/0521/c25130a3053556/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span>浙江大学生命科学研究院</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span>年学</span><span><span>术夏令营将于</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>暑期</span><span>举办</span><span>。</span><span><span>夏令营分两期，每期拟招收营员</span><span>100人左右，第一期时间为7月1日至4日，第二期时间为7月8日至11日。</span></span><span>活动旨在帮助大学生了解国内外生命科学领域的发展前沿及动态，增进对生命科学的研究兴趣，同时也帮助优秀学子更多了解浙江大学生命科学研究院，并报读我院研究生。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>生命科学研究院是浙江大学首个学术特区，以</span><span>“构建一流的人才队伍，开展一流的原创性研究，打造一流的生命科学研究基地”为使命，实现生命科学学科的跨越式发展、推进世界一流大学的建设。研究院确立了癌症生物学、再生医学、炎症生物学、系统生物学和结构生物学5个研究中心，设有细胞生物学、生物化学与分子生物学、生物信息学</span></span><span>、遗传学</span><span>4</span><span><span>个招生专业。各</span><span>PI研究方向及实验室信息详见：http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/ww/list.htm</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>研究院自</span><span>2020级起只招收博士生，欢迎有意向保送我院直博生的202</span></span><span>6</span><span>届本科毕业生报名参加本次夏令营。</span></p><p><span><span>参加夏令营的营员由我院统一安排食宿，并购买在浙大活动期间的团体险，费用由我院承担。外地学生来校交通费可由我院部分报销（限汽车、火车硬座</span><span>/硬卧中上铺、动车/高铁二等座、飞机经济舱）。来校交通费根据发票票面金额实报实销，</span></span><span>上限不超过</span><span>1</span><span>500元，入营报到时须提供纸质</span><span>报销凭证；最终</span><span>报考并进入生研院攻读博士学位的营员</span><span>可</span><span>报销</span><span>返程</span><span>交通</span><span><span>费</span><span>(标准同来校车票)。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>报名要求及流程如下：</span></p><p><span>一</span><span>、申请资格</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>来自全国重点高校生物学、基础医学、药学，以及数学、物理、化学、计算机科学与技术等专业的有志于交叉学科研究的</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>英语水平良好，大学英语六级考试</span><span>460分及以上，托福机考≥80或雅思≥5.5（六级成绩有效期5年，托福和雅思成绩有效期2年，202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月推免申请前取得相应成绩）；</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>学习成绩优秀，可获得推荐免试研究生资格；</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.</span><span>对生命科学有浓厚兴趣，有意向从事科研工作。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>二</span><span>、申请材料及方式</span></p><p><span>请登陆浙江大学</span><span>生命科学研究院</span><span><span>的夏令营申请系统，系统报名链接为：</span><span>https://zju-lsi-xly.mynatapp.cc/user/login</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>填报说明：</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>登录浙江大学生命科学研究院夏令营官方报名网站如实填写；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>意向</span><span>实验室需填写三个</span><span>，实验室信息详见：</span></p><p><span>http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/ww/list.htm</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>将以下材料按顺序整合成一个</span><span>PDF格式文件</span></span><span>并压缩为</span><span>zip文件</span><span><span>，文件名为</span><span>“202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span> </span><span>LSI+</span></span><span>本科学校</span><span>+姓名”，在“</span><span>补充文件</span><span>”栏上传，文件不超过10M。PDF文件由以下材料按顺序生成：</span></p><p><span>a.</span><span><span>《浙江大学生命科学研究院</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年学术夏令营申请表》</span><span>1份（附件）；</span></span></p><p><span>b.</span><span><span>身份证正反扫描件</span><span>1份；</span></span></p><p><span>c</span><span>.本科成绩单1份（须加盖院系或学校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>d</span><span>.总成绩排名1份（须加盖院系或学校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>e</span><span>.英语四、六级证书或其他英语考试的成绩证明1份；</span></p><p><span>f.夏令营邀请函扫描件（若已获得夏令营邀请函）；</span></p><p><span>g</span><span>.其他获奖</span><span>证明</span><span>材料。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>三、</span><span>申请时间</span></p><p><span><span>即日起至</span><span>6月</span></span><span>18</span><span>日（截止时间如有变动，后续将在官网更新）</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>四、</span><span>录取流程</span></p><p><span>1.6月2</span><span>2</span><span>日24时之前，获得参营资格同学请</span><span>在报名系统确认</span><span>是否可以按照要求参加夏令营</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.6月</span><span>26</span><span>日之前，<span>审核学员材料并在院网</span>上公布夏令营学员名单。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>五、活动安排</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）开营仪式：走进浙大首个学术特区，深入了解</span><span>LSI</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/bd54d89aacfe3737953a.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/0082d56fe62a067612c8.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>  （</span><span>2</span><span>）走近实验室：自由参观实验室，感受科研现场</span><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/546557d593e458bce661.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/bc2e393ad64c4f8bfc57.png\"/></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>  （</span><span>3</span><span>）师兄师姐交流会：研究生分享科研生活，指点迷津</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/0ea8d4be36412ac451d0.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/09b317bd755c66761193.jpg\"/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>  （</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>PI面对面</span><span>：师生对话，聚焦科学前沿话题</span><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/78b4c39166c2920d60d3.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/97dc9cfe54bf9d0b68f8.png\"/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>六、</span><span>其他说明</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>营员录取名单以报名系统审核结果为准，未入选者不再另行通知；研究院将根据实际情况统一协调入选者入营时间，入选者如放弃参加夏令营，请及时告知。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生在夏令营期间应遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加活动。</span></p><p><span>    3.</span><span>咨询电话：</span><span><span>周老师：</span><span>0571-88208267</span></span></p><p><span>        邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:zhouying0722@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zhouying0722@zju.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/f1c2f4d9efbb5d1fc301.gif\"/><a href=\"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/dd5ca2d1-93f7-4de9-a486-fdef88f2b473.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学生命科学研究院2025年学术夏令营申请表.doc</a></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8e9a9603d4ec70d38c362ccdf19602c3e7c077b57d7c278e0bc0967e1350fa3a","textLength":1634,"sourceSha256":"ab950338d857459d5da48531598b3d5bce5ad7d116c8b1c4cf9f32d04a81b25d","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-57b2ea133e6503482970","title":"2025年浙江大学生命科学研究院关于举办2025年学术夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:55.674540+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/d9c92ca3-f99d-45ae-83b2-1d1dc1e5f3b2.png","file":"assets/articles/media/bd54d89aacfe3737953a.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/20a9c079-ce8c-434f-bd26-2a843ea00c98.png","file":"assets/articles/media/0082d56fe62a067612c8.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/0fddf7e4-bda9-457c-bbbf-11e0c7ad347f.png","file":"assets/articles/media/546557d593e458bce661.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/506274e3-b900-4532-bf1e-9b692cf3af7a.png","file":"assets/articles/media/bc2e393ad64c4f8bfc57.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/1c9d11bc-20a2-482b-b434-e73b6e96b0ad.png","file":"assets/articles/media/0ea8d4be36412ac451d0.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/5a902e65-d790-48aa-9ffa-b6031ce59647.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/09b317bd755c66761193.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/be631224-b445-4696-b52c-0cc54f3014a9.png","file":"assets/articles/media/78b4c39166c2920d60d3.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4a/d2/e367d9894381a670d2deb10eee40/6e5db8c1-e07e-45f5-922a-519da824ba5a.png","file":"assets/articles/media/97dc9cfe54bf9d0b68f8.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://lsi.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/f1c2f4d9efbb5d1fc301.gif"}]}
